How many more? lots
text_not_number.plain, line 3, while running: Check that "answer" is a number before you add it.

    set total to total plus answer
                            ^^^^^^
Try this:
    if answer is a number
        set total to total plus answer
    otherwise
        show "Please type a number."
Why: You can't add "lots" to 12, because "lots" is text, not a number. "answer" got its value on line 2, from what was typed.
